          <div class="lede">
            <p>I build for people who don't see the screen, and I build from inside
            that, not next to it.</p>
            <p>A field test with blind users tells me more than a demo that looks
            finished.</p>
            <p>I would rather show the range of what I can actually build than claim
            one narrow expertise I don't have.</p>
          </div>
