            <h3><a href="work/third-eye-kit.html">Third Eye Kit</a>
              <span class="p-tag p-mono">Shipped 2022</span></h3>
            <p>Glasses that listened for obstacles, shoes that buzzed, a GPS module.
            About $112. Built at seventeen in Herat and tested with blind users at a
            support centre there, then taken to TEKNOFEST in Turkey, where it won
            Best Presentation.</p>
            <p class="more"><a href="work/third-eye-kit.html">Read the case study</a></p>
          </article>
        </section>

