            <h3><a href="work/third-eye-world.html">Third Eye World</a>
              <span class="p-tag p-mono">Rebuilding</span></h3>
            <p>An accessibility-first social network for blind and low-vision users.
            The first beta leaned on sight more than we wanted. The gestures were
            generic and it took several of them to do one thing. Testers told us, we
            closed the beta, and the MVP is being rebuilt.</p>
            <p class="more"><a href="work/third-eye-world.html">Read the case study</a></p>
